1
00:00:00,047 --> 00:00:01,500
[Wild Stallion]

2
00:00:01,501 --> 00:00:03,795
I'm telling you
what happened in my dream

3
00:00:03,795 --> 00:00:06,047
actually happened
in real life too.

4
00:00:06,047 --> 00:00:07,173
Yeah, that's weird.

5
00:00:08,299 --> 00:00:10,260
Sounds like that guy's
stuck in your head.

6
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,594
Yeah...

7
00:00:11,594 --> 00:00:13,096
Wait, what?

8
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:16,349
You've only been talking
about him since earlier.

9
00:00:16,349 --> 00:00:18,768
Not a single word
about yourself.

10
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:21,563
That's not true.
I talked about me... like...

11
00:00:21,563 --> 00:00:24,024
what I saw
at the futsal court...

12
00:00:24,024 --> 00:00:25,275
stuff like that.

13
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:27,027
Yup, that's what I'm saying.

14
00:00:27,027 --> 00:00:29,237
Come on
just be honest with me.

15
00:00:29,237 --> 00:00:31,531
This penpal thing we do...

16
00:00:31,531 --> 00:00:35,201
It's to talk things out
and focus on soccer, right?

17
00:00:36,661 --> 00:00:38,872
All right, but don't
take this the wrong way.

18
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:40,165
Promise?

19
00:00:40,165 --> 00:00:41,875
Yeah. I promise.

20
00:00:42,542 --> 00:00:45,295
It's simple.

21
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:47,839
Whenever I'm around him...

22
00:00:47,839 --> 00:00:50,175
I get tense.

23
00:00:50,175 --> 00:00:53,178
Without even realizing it.

24
00:00:54,763 --> 00:00:57,724
This is all new to me, and I
have no idea where it's going.

25
00:00:58,099 --> 00:01:01,686
It's your first time.
No need to rush anything.

26
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:04,105
You think so?

27
00:01:04,272 --> 00:01:08,234
You'll know with time.

28
00:01:08,526 --> 00:01:10,487
That's how it was for me too.

29
00:01:19,579 --> 00:01:22,207
I bet you can't wait
to run again.

30
00:01:22,207 --> 00:01:26,252
With time
you'll be back on the field.

31
00:01:26,252 --> 00:01:28,171
Anyway, speaking of which

32
00:01:28,171 --> 00:01:31,174
why is it so hard today?

33
00:01:31,174 --> 00:01:33,968
You really going to whine
in front of Seung-hyun?

34
00:01:33,968 --> 00:01:35,804
Be professional.

35
00:01:35,804 --> 00:01:37,555
Dude, look at my hands.

36
00:01:37,555 --> 00:01:39,057
They're wrecked.

37
00:01:39,057 --> 00:01:40,433
Drama queen...

38
00:01:40,433 --> 00:01:41,351
Hey, come on!

39
00:01:41,351 --> 00:01:42,143
Yeah, yeah.

40
00:01:42,143 --> 00:01:43,686
You're right.

41
00:01:43,686 --> 00:01:45,522
Hope you don't
mind him, Seung-hyun.

42
00:01:47,023 --> 00:01:49,109
Wow. Harsh.

43
00:01:49,109 --> 00:01:52,112
Guess I'm the fool now, huh?
